---
# Narrow, high-signal check set. The broad `misc-*` style checks are
# deliberately off: enabling them produces ~3.4k findings that are mechanical
# rather than diagnostic (const-correctness alone is 2.2k), which would bury
# the handful of checks that actually catch defects here.
#
# Run:  run-clang-tidy -p build 'src/roxy/.*\.cpp'
#
# Notable exclusions and why (finding counts measured against the tree):
#   bugprone-switch-missing-default-case  (17)
#       NOT because it conflicts with -Wswitch — it can't: it fires only on
#       *non-enum* switches, which is exactly what -Wswitch doesn't cover.
#       Excluded on signal instead: all 17 hits (15 in lexer.cpp over `char`,
#       2 in roxy_rt.cpp) already have an explicit fallback after the switch,
#       so there is nothing latent behind them.
#   bugprone-branch-clone  (19)
#       The remaining hits are deliberate parallel structure — two distinct
#       reasons to emit the same token, table-shaped if/else chains. Note this
#       check did earn its keep once (it found a genuinely dead if/else in
#       json.cpp), so revisit if the count ever moves.
#   bugprone-throwing-static-initialization  (2)
#       False positives: `Vector(Index size = 0)` only allocates when size > 0,
#       so the default-constructed globals it flags cannot throw.
#   performance-no-int-to-ptr  (77)
#       The slab allocator round-trips integers and pointers by design
#       (generational refs, tombstoning). All intentional.
#   bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters  (128)
#       Structural complaints about a recursive-descent compiler; not actionable.
#   performance-enum-size  (1)
#       Changing an enum's underlying type is a layout change for negligible gain.
Checks: >
  bugprone-*,
  performance-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  readability-redundant-casting,
  readability-redundant-string-init,
  modernize-use-nullptr,
  modernize-use-override,
  -bugprone-branch-clone,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-switch-missing-default-case,
  -bugprone-throwing-static-initialization,
  -performance-no-int-to-ptr,
  -performance-enum-size

# Own headers only — vendored doctest/tsl/xxhash are excluded.
HeaderFilterRegex: 'roxy/(compiler|vm|rt|lsp|shared|core)/(?!doctest/|tsl/|xxhash)'
FormatStyle: none
WarningsAsErrors: ''
